abstract: >
  Python implementation of the agent-based model presented in the paper
  "Boundary-Mediated Global Connectivity in Structured Agent-Based Systems".
  The repository contains the simulation framework, experimental pipeline,
  data aggregation scripts, and figure-generation workflow used to reproduce
  all results reported in the manuscript.

license: "MIT"

repository-code: "https://github.com/meccanismocomplesso/boundary-connectivity-abm"

